{"id":"paliza","lemma":"paliza","pos":"noun","rank":1887,"glosses":["beating, bashing","rout, hammering, trouncing, beating (the act of completely defeating an army or other enemy force, causing it to retreat in a disorganized manner; (by extension) in politics, sport, etc.: a convincing defeat)"],"ipa":"/paˈliθa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"palizas"},"examples":[{"text":"Te daré una paliza.","en":"I'll beat you up!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442835","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Yo soy el que recibió la paliza.","en":"I'm the one who got beat up.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803546","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null,{"g":"to receive, get","l":"recibir"},{"g":"the / her"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"that"]]},{"text":"¿Van ellos a darme una paliza?","en":"Are they going to beat me up?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803545","words":[{"g":"van"},{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Dame tu dinero o te daré una paliza.","en":"Give me your money or else I'll beat you up.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693667","words":[{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"money"},{"g":"or"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Tom recibió una paliza.","en":"Tom was beat up.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799924","words":[null,{"g":"to receive, get","l":"recibir"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}